# SEO — mandatory for every page

Follow repo-root **`AGENTS.md`** (SEO section) on every page create/edit.

**Before finishing any page work:**

1. Read `lib/seo.ts` + `lib/seo-pages.ts`.
2. Add/update colocated `layout.tsx` with unique metadata via `@/lib/seo`.
3. Dashboard / private routes → `privateAppPageMetadata(title, description, path)`.
4. Register static private paths in `PRIVATE_APP_PAGES` (`lib/seo-pages.ts`).
5. Dynamic routes → `generateMetadata` in `[param]/layout.tsx`.
6. Public indexable URLs only → `buildPageMetadata` + entry in `app/sitemap.ts`.
7. New private URL prefixes → add to `app/robots.ts` disallow prefixes.

Do **not** mark page work done without SEO. Do **not** ship UI-only pages without metadata.
